# clickjacking-audit Rule

When auditing clickjacking:
1. Follow `.agents/skills/clickjacking-audit/references/clickjacking_checklist.md` (CJ-001 to CJ-010, CJ-V-*). PoCs: `references/clickjacking_poc_templates.md`.
2. Master skill: `.agents/skills/clickjacking-audit/SKILL.md`. Track progress with `references/clickjacking_tracker.md`.
3. Run `scripts/scope_check.sh TARGET` first, then `.agents/skills/clickjacking-audit/scripts/clickjack_check.py` with your own session.
4. Frameable is a lead; a finding is a sensitive action completed on your own victim account through the frame, logged in, in a current browser.
